  ('job_gk_0001','comp_meituan','English textbackendengineer(transactionplatform)','Shanghai','backend',4500000,7000000,16,'5-10','master','The Meituan transaction platform team builds the high-concurrency transaction backend that powers order and payment flows. You will own database sharding for core order stores, evolve the configuration center that drives runtime configuration changes, and strengthen service governance across thousands of microservices.','English text Java English text Spring Cloud；English text、English text、English text；English texttransactionEnglish text。','Java,English text,transaction','open','2026-06-01T09:00:00Z'),
